              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A River Deep collaboration · Elkstone Farm"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 1
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Integrated Man"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A men’s weekend in the mountains outside Steamboat Springs, Colorado. Three days around council and fire, in the body and on the cushion, to see what’s been holding you back and claim what’s yours to do."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_hnnskjzjpx",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "why",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_2x9sghnr75",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Why this weekend"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "One life. One pass through to bring your gifts fully into the world."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The weekend is built to help men see, claim and clarify their purpose in the places that matter most: sex and intimacy, money and work, connection with other men, self-respect, and following through."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "What men take home:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "A clear look at where you’re drifting, with direct feedback on what it costs you"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Practices that work under pressure"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Stronger self-trust and a clearer standard for yourself as a man"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Real connection with other men"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_cs4hna16hy",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "for-you",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "dark"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_e9cym35xz8",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Who it’s for"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Men who are drifting and ready to stop."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Often men who are doing well at work and struggling at home or in community. Men who want power without rigidity or anger, and heart without erasing themselves."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Distance in emotional or physical intimacy, or a partnership that has lost its passion"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Money patterns, temper, discipline, or a phone that eats your attention"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Soft boundaries with a boss, partner, children or parents"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Feeling numb, or unsure what you’re actually feeling"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Overwhelm from the state of the world, or a missing sense of purpose"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Work that pays and doesn’t fulfill"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This weekend isn’t therapy, and it isn’t a place to apologize for being a man or to hide in debate. It’s built for change that holds up once you’re home."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_8c381nsc85",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "anchor": "practices",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
